---
import Subscribe from './Subscribe.astro';
---
<footer>
    <div class="container">
        <Subscribe />
        <div class="footer-inner">
            <div style="max-width: 600px;">
                <p>&copy; 2019&ndash;2026 OWASP Sofia Chapter. Част от <a href="https://owasp.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OWASP Foundation, Inc.</a></p>
                <p style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.7; line-height: 1.7;">
                    Всички OWASP материали са безплатни и достъпни под
                    <a href="https://owasp.org/about/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">отворен лиценз</a>.
                    OWASP не одобрява и не препоръчва комерсиални продукти или услуги.
                </p>
                <p style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.72rem; opacity: 0.55; line-height: 1.7;">
                    OWASP, логото на OWASP и Global AppSec са регистрирани търговски марки.
                    AppSec Days, AppSec California, AppSec Cali, SnowFROC, OWASP Boston Application Security Conference
                    и LASCON са търговски марки на OWASP Foundation, Inc.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-right">
                <div class="footer-social">
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/107314221/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="LinkedIn"><svg class="icon-svg"><use href="#icon-linkedin"/></svg></a>
                    <a href="https://www.facebook.com/owaspbg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Facebook"><svg class="icon-svg"><use href="#icon-facebook"/></svg></a>
                    <a href="https://discord.com/channels/849266967856414731/981867323298312223" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Discord"><svg class="icon-svg"><use href="#icon-discord"/></svg></a>
                    <a href="https://www.meetup.com/owasp-sofia-chapter/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Meetup" aria-label="Meetup"><svg class="icon-svg"><use href="#icon-meetup"/></svg></a>
                    <a href="https://luma.com/owasp-sofia" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Luma" aria-label="Luma"><svg class="icon-svg"><use href="#icon-luma"/></svg></a>
                    <a href="https://github.com/owaspbg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="GitHub" aria-label="GitHub"><svg class="icon-svg"><use href="#icon-github"/></svg></a>
                    <a href="mailto:contact@owasp.bg" title="contact@owasp.bg" aria-label="Имейл: contact@owasp.bg"><svg class="icon-svg"><use href="#icon-email"/></svg></a>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-links">
                    <a href="/policies/">Правила и очаквания</a>
                    <a href="/policies/#code-of-conduct">Кодекс на поведение</a>
                    <a href="/policies/#hosting">Домакинство</a>
                    <a href="/policies/#presenting">Презентации</a>
                    <a href="/policies/#branding">Брандинг</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
